/**
 * t08 · Plain
 *
 * A bubble reduced to the two primitives it cannot do without: a rounded
 * rectangle and a notch. Radius 2, so the corners are softened rather than
 * rounded; the tail is a straight-sided triangle with a vertical left edge and
 * no curve anywhere in it.
 *
 * One fill. No keyline, no shading, no highlight — this is the floor of the
 * set, drawn so the others have something honest to be measured against.
 * The face has 10 px of air left and right and 7 above.
 */
